# Analytics

Sources: `packages/web/src/shared/lib/analytics/analytics.ts`, `types.ts`, and `setup.ts` in that directory.

- Use the existing event taxonomy and provider interface; inspect them instead of copying an event list into documentation.
- Preserve consent gating and reset behavior. A configured provider is not permission to transmit events before consent.
- Track meaningful completed actions only when needed; do not add tracking to every UI interaction by default.
- Never send message text, drafts, credentials, names, email addresses, or arbitrary URLs/query strings. Redaction is a backup, not permission to pass sensitive input.
- Tests must not contact analytics providers. Isolate consent, queues, storage, and provider state between tests.
